  "per magnitude step. Stated as a number of kilotons of TNT the scale becomes easier to feel — and the gap between a damaging quake and a catastrophic one becomes obvious.": "kada hakbang ng magnitude. Kapag isinaad bilang bilang ng kilotons ng TNT, mas madaling madama ang scale — at nagiging maliwanag ang agwat sa pagitan ng isang mapaminsalang lindol at ng isang katastropiko.",
